    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544690/extras/95545c31bf44757034dee5cafc9276dc.poster.avif?t=1749790462\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544690/extras/95545c31bf44757034dee5cafc9276dc.webm?t=1749790462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544690/extras/95545c31bf44757034dee5cafc9276dc.mp4?t=1749790462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Lisa's backpack was stolen and she wants it back. Help her overcome a difficult route along the beautiful coast. Will you be able to overcome all the obstacles along the way? Will you be able to catch the thief?<br><br>Game Features:<br>  - Ride your motorcycle through beautiful landscapes<br>  - Enjoy a pleasant atmosphere<br>  - Many different levels<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544690/extras/2ccf51d8a805059e910df677f11dc9da.poster.avif?t=1749790462\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544690/extras/2ccf51d8a805059e910df677f11dc9da.webm?t=1749790462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544690/extras/2ccf51d8a805059e910df677f11dc9da.mp4?t=1749790462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
